### 3.1. Extensions to the `[Screen](https://www.w3.org/TR/cssom-view-1/#screen)` interface[](#api-extensions-to-screen)

The [CSSOM View Module](#biblio-cssom-view-1 "CSSOM View Module") specification defines the `[Screen](https://www.w3.org/TR/cssom-view-1/#screen)` interface, which this specification extends:

